{"language":"en","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","浮空辉刃"],["/skills/0/name_i18n/en","Aloft Edge"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","召唤飞剑攻击敌人。"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/en","Silven summons flying blades to attack enemies."],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","休召唤6把飞剑，接下来的普通攻击会控制这些飞剑攻击敌人，每把飞剑造成70% + 9% ATK伤害，持续8秒。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Silven summons 6 flying blades. For the next 8s, normal attacks will launch the summoned blades at enemies, with each blade dealing 70% + 9% ATK damage."],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":37,"end":42,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":135,"end":140,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":34,"end":46,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":132,"end":144,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","每把飞剑伤害提升至75% + 9% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Each blade deals 75% + 9% ATK damage."],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":17,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":20,"end":25,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":21,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":17,"end":29,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","每把飞剑伤害提升至80% + 9% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Each blade deals 80% + 9% ATK damage."],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":17,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":20,"end":25,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":21,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":17,"end":29,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","每把飞剑伤害提升至85% + 9% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/en","Each blade deals 85% + 9% ATK damage."],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":17,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":20,"end":25,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":21,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":17,"end":29,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","每把飞剑伤害提升至90% + 9% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/en","Each blade deals 90% + 9% ATK damage."],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":17,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":20,"end":25,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":21,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":17,"end":29,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","重力坍塌"],["/skills/1/name_i18n/en","Gravity Collapse"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","对敌人施加重力使其倒地，并引爆目标身上的剑魂。"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/en","Silven knocks the enemy down with the force of gravity and detonates the Blademarks on them."],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","休使用普通攻击发射飞剑命中敌人时，会在敌人身上留下剑魂，休每进行4次普通攻击，下一次普通攻击会改为对持有剑魂最多的敌人释放“重力坍塌”，造成200% + 30% ATK伤害并使其倒地2秒，同时引爆敌人身上的所有剑魂，每道剑魂对该敌人额外附加36% + 3% ATK伤害。在“浮空辉刃”生效期间，“重力坍塌”的范围扩展至周围1格，并且会额外发射飞剑，造成6次48% + 6% ATK伤害。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/en","When a flying blade sent by Silven's normal attacks hits an enemy, it leaves a Blademark. After performing 4 normal attacks, Silven's next normal attack turns into Gravity Collapse on the enemy with the most Blademarks. Gravity Collapse deals 200% + 30% ATK damage, knocks the enemy down for 2s, and detonates all Blademarks on that enemy to deal an extra 36% + 3% ATK damage. \nIf Aloft Edge is active, increases the range of Gravity Collapse by 1 tile, and launches extra flying blades, dealing 48% + 6% ATK damage 6 times."],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":74,"end":80,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":123,"end":128,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"},{"start":181,"end":186,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":247,"end":253,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":359,"end":364,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"},{"start":499,"end":504,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":70,"end":84,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":120,"end":132,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":178,"end":190,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":243,"end":257,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":356,"end":368,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":496,"end":508,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","“重力坍塌”伤害提升至220% + 30% ATK，“浮空辉刃”状态下每段伤害提升至52% + 6% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Increases the damage of Gravity Collapse to 220% + 30% ATK. While Aloft Edge is active, increases damage per blade to 52% + 6% ATK."],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":15,"end":21,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":45,"end":50,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":48,"end":54,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":121,"end":126,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":25,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":42,"end":54,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":44,"end":58,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":118,"end":130,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","“重力坍塌”伤害提升至240% + 30% ATK，“浮空辉刃”状态下每段伤害提升至56% + 6% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Increases the damage of Gravity Collapse to 240% + 30% ATK. While Aloft Edge is active, increases damage per blade to 56% + 6% ATK."],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":15,"end":21,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":45,"end":50,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":48,"end":54,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":121,"end":126,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":25,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":42,"end":54,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":44,"end":58,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":118,"end":130,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","“重力坍塌”伤害提升至260% + 30% ATK，“浮空辉刃”状态下每段伤害提升至60% + 6% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/en","Increases the damage of Gravity Collapse to 260% + 30% ATK. While Aloft Edge is active, increases damage per blade to 60% + 6% ATK."],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":15,"end":21,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":45,"end":50,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":48,"end":54,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":121,"end":126,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":25,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":42,"end":54,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":44,"end":58,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":118,"end":130,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","淬火力场"],["/skills/2/name_i18n/en","Tempered Field"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","布置力场强化飞剑。"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/en","Silven sets up a field to enhance his flying blades."],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗开始时，休在自身周围布置“淬火力场”，力场存在时，自身提升48点远程防御。休释放的飞剑穿过力场后将会获得强化，附带敌人最大生命值1.3% + 0.2%的真实伤害（最高不超过14% + 2% ATK）。力场会在自身位置变化后消失，并在自身位置连续不变3秒后重新生成。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/en","When a battle starts, Silven sets up a Tempered Field around himself, increasing his Ranged DEF by 48 while the field is active. Silven's flying blades sharpen when passing through the field, dealing extra true damage equal to 1.3% + 0.2% of the target's max HP, up to 14% + 2% ATK. The field disappears if Silven moves, and will reappear after he stands still for 3s."],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":70,"end":77,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"},{"start":91,"end":96,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":231,"end":238,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"},{"start":272,"end":277,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":88,"end":100,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":269,"end":281,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","附加伤害提升至目标最大生命值的1.4% + 0.2%，最高不超过16% + 2% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Increases extra true damage to 1.4% + 0.2% of the target's max HP, up to 16% + 2% ATK."],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":19,"end":26,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"},{"start":35,"end":40,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":35,"end":42,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"},{"start":76,"end":81,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":32,"end":44,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":73,"end":85,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","附加伤害提升至目标最大生命值的1.5% + 0.2%，最高不超过18% + 2% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Increases extra true damage to 1.5% + 0.2% of the target's max HP, up to 18% + 2% ATK."],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":19,"end":26,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"},{"start":35,"end":40,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":35,"end":42,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"},{"start":76,"end":81,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":32,"end":44,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":73,"end":85,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","附加伤害提升至目标最大生命值的1.6% + 0.2%，最高不超过20% + 2% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/en","Increases extra true damage to 1.6% + 0.2% of the target's max HP, up to 20% + 2% ATK."],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":19,"end":26,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"},{"start":35,"end":40,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":35,"end":42,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"},{"start":76,"end":81,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":32,"end":44,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":73,"end":85,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/name_i18n/en","Hero Focus"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","提升攻击速度。"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/en","Increases ATK SPD."],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的攻击速度提高21点。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Increases ATK SPD by 21 during battle."],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的攻击速度提高27点。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Increases ATK SPD by 27 during battle."],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的攻击速度提高33点。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Increases ATK SPD by 33 during battle."],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","授勋仪式"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/en","Oath of Fealty"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","自身获得友军施加的非永久属性提升时会获得能量和穿透，并提升双方的攻击速度。"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/en","When Silven receives a temporary stat buff from an ally, he gains Energy, Penetration and ATK SPD."],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","当自身获得一名友军施加的非永久属性提升效果时，休立刻回复300点能量，并永久提高4点穿透，此外还会使双方攻击速度均永久提升16点，该效果每名友军至多触发一次。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/en","When Silven receives a temporary stat buff from an ally, he immediately recovers 300 Energy and permanently gains 4 Penetration. He also permanently increases the ATK SPD of both himself and that ally by 16. This effect can only be triggered once per ally."],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","休获得的穿透提高至6点。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Increases the Penetration Silven gains to 6."],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","该效果触发2次后，休额外提升15%攻击力。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/en","After the effect triggers 2 times, Silven gains an extra 15% ATK."],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","休获得的穿透提高至8点。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/en","Increases the Penetration Silven gains to 8."],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/en","Enhance Force"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","休对高生命值比例的敌人造成更高伤害。"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/en","Silven deals more damage to enemies with a high HP ratio."],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","休在面对强力的敌人时能展现高昂的骑士精神，对当前生命值比例高于50%的敌人造成的伤害提升25%。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/en","When up against powerful foes, Silven's knightly spirit kicks in, allowing him to deal 25% more damage to enemies whose current HP ratio is higher than 50%."],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","誓约之手"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/en","Hands of Glory"]]}